  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Governance Program 2017-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Governance Program supported three strategic objectives: stability, enabling economic growth, and enhancing human development. The program had four lines of effort: incentivising  fiscally and socially responsible budgeting and borrowing policies; supporting a professional public financial management cadre that facilitated improved service delivery; contributing to a more accountable and responsive public service; and strengthening coalitions for reform.</narrative>
  </description>
